      "text": "\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\frac{1}{\\cos 80^\\circ} - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sin 80^\\circ} \\\\\n&= \\frac{\\sin 80^\\circ - \\sqrt{3} \\cos 80^\\circ}{\\sin 80^\\circ \\cos 80^\\circ} \\\\\n&= \\frac{2\\left( \\frac{1}{2} \\sin 80^\\circ - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\cos 80^\\circ \\right)}{\\frac{1}{2} \\sin 160^\\circ} \\\\\n&= \\frac{2 \\sin \\left(80^\\circ - 60^\\circ\\right)}{\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot 0.9397} \\\\\n&= \\frac{2 \\sin (20^\\circ)}{0.46985} \\\\\n&= \\boxed{4.12}.\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]",
